      "content": "Those thoughts of wanting everything to stop are a sign of immense, unbearable pain, and I want you to know that these intense feelings are treatable. If you are feeling like \"exiting the game,\" please reach out immediately to a crisis line like 988 or your local emergency services. These professional lines are there specifically for moments of feeling trapped and completely hopeless. Your life matters, and there are people who want to help you find a path through this heavy cycle.",
